<%# Handoff 0090 -- the series page's section links (소개 · 에피소드), right under the purchase box. Sticky just under
    the sticky header: the header is 65px tall on mobile (the 40px menu button) and 63px from md up (the bordered
    login / logout button), so the bar sticks 1px higher than that and slides under the header's bottom border -- never
    a gap, whatever the font rounding. Its own background hides the text scrolling under it. Shown only with two or
    more sections (series_section_nav_items -- the same conditions that draw the sections).
    The links work as plain anchors; section_nav_controller only marks the section in view (aria-current). %>
<% if items.size > 1 %>
  <nav aria-label="가이드 바로가기" data-controller="section-nav"
    class="sticky top-[64px] z-40 -mx-2.5 mt-3 border-b border-white/10 bg-[#0e1014] px-2.5 sm:-mx-7 sm:mt-6 sm:px-7 md:top-[62px]">
    <%# 0094 A9 -- 16px at every width, a bit less padding on phones. %>
    <ul class="flex gap-6 text-base font-semibold">
      <% items.each do |label, id| %>
        <li>
          <a href="#<%= id %>" data-section-nav-target="link"
            class="inline-block border-b-2 border-transparent py-2 text-[#a8a39a] sm:py-2.5 transition hover:text-[#f2efe8] aria-[current=true]:border-[#f0a53c] aria-[current=true]:text-[#f2efe8]"><%= label %></a>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </nav>
<% end %>
